{"step_index":52,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-18T09:16:59Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-18T14:46:59+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-10-18T14:47:00+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///Users/dev/Documents/Antigravity/Signal-foundry/README.md`\nTotal Lines: 112\nTotal Bytes: 5499\nShowing lines 1 to 60\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # SignalFoundry\n2: \n3: > **\"Find the leak. Fix the workflow.\"**  \n4: > Focused diagnostics for lost enquiries, difficult tenders, and fragile automations. Clear evidence, a prioritized answer, and no oversized consulting projects.\n5: \n6: Imported from ChatGPT / Codex session (`01a0660f-2dc9-7db3-ac52-1792a787593b`).\n7: \n8: ---\n9: \n10: ## 🧭 Four Core Services\n11: \n12: 1. **Revenue Leak Forensics** (Sri Lanka · Revenue Operations)\n13:    - Audits WhatsApp and enquiry processes to identify unanswered leads, slow replies, and missing follow-up sequences without replacing current tools.\n14:    - *Pilot Pricing*: Founding pilot LKR 4,900 · then LKR 8,900.\n15: 2. **Tender Bid Passport** (Sri Lanka · Tender Intelligence)\n16:    - Evaluates tender notices and company profiles into a clear go/no-go brief: eligibility, missing documents, deadlines, red flags, and next actions.\n17:    - *Pilot Pricing*: Founding pilot LKR 5,900 · then LKR 9,900.\n18: 3. **Automation Risk Preflight** (Worldwide · Automation Governance)\n19:    - Inspects n8n, Make, Zapier, or agent workflows; maps third-party actions against published platform policies to avoid sudden suspensions or API bans.\n20:    - *Pilot Pricing*: Founding audit US$49 · then US$99.\n21: 4. **Workflow ER** (Worldwide · Automation Repair)\n22:    - Diagnoses and repairs unreliable workflows: webhook failures, duplicate records, data mapping mismatches, rate-limits, and silent failures.\n23:    - *Pilot Pricing*: Diagnostic free · fixed-scope rescue from US$49.\n24: \n25: ---\n26: \n27: ## 📁 Repository Structure\n28: \n29:\n<truncated 407 bytes>\ntyling and theme tokens\n36: │   │   ├── layout.tsx                 # Root layout & meta tags\n37: │   │   └── chatgpt-auth.ts            # ChatGPT authentication helpers (optional)\n38: │   ├── public/                        # OpenGraph images, favicons, SVGs\n39: │   ├── package.json                   # Dependencies and npm scripts\n40: │   ├── tsconfig.json                  # TypeScript configuration\n41: │   └── vite.config.ts                 # Vinext / Cloudflare configuration\n42: ├── cloudflare-pages/                  # Static build deployed to Cloudflare Pages\n43: │   ├── index.html                     # Main landing page\n44: │   ├── intake.html                    # Pilot intake form (FormSubmit-powered)\n45: │   ├── thanks.html                    # Submission confirmation page\n46: │   ├── sitemap.xml                    # Sitemap for Search Console\n47: │   ├── robots.txt\n48: │   └── _headers                       # Cloudflare HTTP security headers\n49: ├── operations/                        # Commercial and operational launch kit\n50: │   ├── Revenue-Leak-Operations.xlsx   # Financial & pipeline workbook\n51: │   ├── sample-reports/                # Sample client-ready PDF deliverables\n52: │   │   ├── Automation-Risk-Preflight-Sample.pdf\n53: │   │   ├── Tender-Bid-Passport-Sample.pdf\n54: │   │   └── Workflow-ER-Sample.pdf\n55: │   ├── prospects/                     # Targeted leads databases (local & intl)\n56: │   │   ├── prospect-tracker.csv\n57: │   │   ├── outreach-log.csv\n58: │   │   ├── local-revenue-leak-prospects.csv\n59: │   │   ├── international-revenue-leak-prospects.csv\n60: │   │   └── international-prospects.csv\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
