{"step_index":54,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-18T09:17:01Z","input_tokens":3379,"cache_read_tokens":53858,"output_tokens":469,"thinking":"The system's core function is not related to trading bots, it is necessary to identify the origin of \"trading bot\" references. A system-wide search will be performed to locate any files or chat logs containing the terms \"trading bot\", \"trading\", or \"bot check\". This will help determine where the term originated within the system. The search will cover all relevant files within the designated directory, excluding irrelevant or large files to expedite the process.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"python3 -c \\\"\\nimport os, glob\\n\\nexclude_dirs = {'.git', 'node_modules', 'Library', '.cache', '.npm', '.cargo', '.rustup', '.local', 'site-packages'}\\n\\nmatches = []\\nfor root, dirs, files in os.walk('/Users/dev'):\\n    dirs[:] = [d for d in dirs if d not in exclude_dirs]\\n    for f in files:\\n        if any(f.endswith(ext) for ext in ['.md', '.txt', '.py', '.json', '.sh', '.html', '.ts', '.js']):\\n            p = os.path.join(root, f)\\n            try:\\n                if os.path.getsize(p) < 10*1024*1024:\\n                    with open(p, 'r', errors='ignore') as fp:\\n                        text = fp.read()\\n                        if 'trading bot' in text.lower() or 'tradingbot' in text.lower():\\n                            matches.append((os.path.getmtime(p), p))\\n            except:\\n                pass\\n\\nmatches.sort(reverse=True)\\nfor mtime, p in matches[:30]:\\n    print(mtime, p)\\n\\\"\"","Cwd":"\"/Users/dev\"","IsDaemon":"false","RequestedTerminalID":"\"\"","RunPersistent":"false","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolAction":"\"Searching trading bot in all files\"","toolSummary":"\"Find trading bot references across files\""}}]}
{"step_index":55,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-10-18T09:17:16Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-18T14:47:16+05:30\nTool is running as a background task with task id: fbbefb03-c012-4cd6-882c-39f6295a6918/task-55\nTask Description: python3 -c \"\nimport os, glob\n\nexclude_dirs = {'.git', 'node_modules', 'Library', '.cache', '.npm', '.cargo', '.rustup', '.local', 'site-packages'}\n\nmatches = []\nfor root, dirs, files in os.walk('/Users/dev'):\n    dirs[:] = [d for d in dirs if d not in exclude_dirs]\n    for f in files:\n        if any(f.endswith(ext) for ext in ['.md', '.txt', '.py', '.json', '.sh', '.html', '.ts', '.js']):\n            p = os.path.join(root, f)\n            try:\n                if os.path.getsize(p) < 10*1024*1024:\n                    with open(p, 'r', errors='ignore') as fp:\n                        text = fp.read()\n                        if 'trading bot' in text.lower() or 'tradingbot' in text.lower():\n                            matches.append((os.path.getmtime(p), p))\n            except:\n                pass\n\nmatches.sort(reverse=True)\nfor mtime, p in matches[:30]:\n    print(mtime, p)\n\"\nTask logs are available at: file:///Users/dev/.gemini/antigravity/brain/fbbefb03-c012-4cd6-882c-39f6295a6918/.system_generated/tasks/task-55.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
